msgid ""
msgstr ""#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:1
msgid "Triton-Ascend FAQ"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend FAQ"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:3
msgid "1. 安装与环境配置"
msgstr "1\. Installation and Environment Configuration"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:5
msgid "**Q: 如何正确安装 Triton-Ascend？是否支持 pip 直接安装？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: How can I correctly install Triton-Ascend? Is it possible to"
"install it directly using pip?**"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:7
msgid "A: 可以直接使用pip 安装"
msgstr "A: You can directly use pip to install it."

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:13
msgid "**Q: 社区 Triton 和 Triton-Ascend 能否同时存在？**"
msgstr "**Q: Can community Triton and Triton-Ascend coexist?**"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:15
msgid ""
"A: triton-ascend 3.2.0 及以下不可以。需要先卸载社区 Triton，再安装 Triton-Ascend。<br> "
"triton-ascend 3.2.1 及以上，Triton-Ascend 通过将 Triton 声明为安装依赖来缓解安装覆盖问题。 安装 "
"Triton-Ascend 时会先安装社区 Triton，再由 Triton-Ascend 覆盖同名目录，从而避免后续安装其他依赖 Triton "
"的软件包时再次安装 Triton 而覆盖 Triton-Ascend。 x86 与 arm 使用不同版本的社区 Triton 安装包的原因是社区从"
" 3.5 版本开始才提供 arm 版本安装包：x86 依赖 triton==3.2.0，arm 依赖 triton==3.5.0。"
msgstr ""
"A: For Triton-Ascend 3.2.0 and earlier versions.You need to uninstall"
"the community Triton first before installing Triton-Ascend.<br>"
" For Triton-Ascend 3.2.1 and later versions.Triton-Ascend declares"
"Triton as an installation dependency to mitigate the installation"
"overwriting issue.When installing"
"Triton-Ascend,the community Triton is installed first,and the"
"Triton-Ascend overwrites the directory with the same name."
"This prevents the installation of triton from overwriting Triton-Ascend"
"when other software packages that depend on Triton are installed."
"The reason why x86 and arm use different versions of the community"
"Triton installation package is that the community provides the arm"
"installation package only form version 3.2.1 onwards."
"Specifically,x86 depends on triton==3.2.0,and arm depends on"
"triton==3.5.0."

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:20
msgid ""
"注：若安装triton-ascend后，在安装依赖triton的三方件或者triton本身，将覆盖掉已安装的 Triton-Ascend 目录。 "
"此时需要先卸载社区 Triton 和 Triton-Ascend，再安装 Triton-Ascend。"
msgstr ""
"Note: If you install a third-party software or triton itself that"
"depends on Triton after installing Triton-Ascend,the installed"
"Triton-Ascend directory will be overwritten."
"In this case, you also need to uninstall the community Triton and"
"Triton-Ascend first before installing Triton-Ascend."

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:29
msgid "**Q: 能否在非 Ascend 硬件（如 CUDA AMD）上使用 Triton-Ascend？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: Can Triton-Ascend be used on non-Ascend hardware (such as CUDA"
"AMD)?**"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:31
msgid "A: 不可以，只能在 Ascend NPU 硬件环境使用 Triton-Ascend"
msgstr ""
"A: No. Triton-Ascend can be used only in the Ascend NPU hardware"
"environment."

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:33
msgid "2. 精度与数值一致性问题"
msgstr "2\. Accuracy and Numerical Consistency Issues"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:35
msgid "**Q: NPU 运行结果和 PyTorch/CPU/GPU 参考结果不一致，如何排查？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: How can I troubleshoot the inconsistency between the NPU running"
"result and the PyTorch/CPU/GPU reference result?**"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:37
msgid ""
"A: 用例请参考 "
"[07_accuracy_comparison_example.md](examples/07_accuracy_comparison_example.md)"
" 调试方法请参考 [解释器模式调试方法](./debug_guide/debugging.md#4-解释器模式)"
msgstr ""
"A: For details, see [07_accuracy_comparison_example.md](examples/07_accu"
"racy_comparison_example.md)."
"For details about the debugging method, see [Debugging in Interpreter"
"Mode](./debug_guide/debugging.md#4-interpreter-mode)."

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:40
msgid "3. 错误代码与异常处理"
msgstr "3\. Error Code and Exception Handling"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:42
msgid "**Q: 为什么 kernel 编译时报 MLIRCompilationError？如何定位具体失败的 Pass？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: Why is the error message \"MLIRCompilationError\" displayed during"
"kernel compilation? How can I locate the failed pass?**"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:44
msgid "A: 请参考 [编译错误调试方法](./debug_guide/debugging.md#52-编译错误调试方法)"
msgstr ""
"A: For details, see [Compilation Error Debugging](./debug_guide/debuggin"
"g.md#52-compilation-error-debugging)."

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:46
msgid "4. 调试与日志"
msgstr "4\. Debugging and Logging"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:48
msgid "**Q: 如何开启详细日志输出？TRITON_DEBUG=1 输出在哪？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: How can I enable detailed log output? Where is the output of"
"TRITON_DEBUG=1?**"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:50
msgid ""
"A: 可以使用 TRITON_DEBUG=1 获取详细的调试转储文件，请参考 [调试转储文件（Dump "
"Files）](./debug_guide/debugging.md#32-调试转储文件dump-files)"
msgstr ""
"A: You can use **TRITON_DEBUG=1** to obtain detailed dump files for"
"debugging. For details, see [Dump Files](./debug_guide/debugging.md#32-d"
"ump-files)."

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:52
msgid "**Q: 能否在 kernel 中打印中间张量值？tl.device_print 是否可用？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: Can I print the intermediate tensor value in the kernel? Is"
"tl.device_print available?**"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:54
msgid ""
"A: 可以使用 tl.device_print 打印 kernel 中的张量，请参考 "
"[打印调试方法](debug_guide/debugging.md#51-打印调试方法)"
msgstr ""
"A: You can use tl.device_print to print the tensor in the kernel. For"
"details, see [Debugging by Printing](./debug_guide/debugging.md#51-debug"
"ging-by-printing)."

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:56
msgid "5. 开发与贡献"
msgstr "5\. Development and Contributions"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:58
msgid "**Q: 如何本地构建并测试 Triton-Ascend？**"
msgstr "**Q: How can I build and test Triton-Ascend locally?**"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:60
msgid ""
"A: 本地构建和测试方法，请参考 [通过源码安装Triton-Ascend](./installation_guide.md"
"#通过源码安装triton-ascend)"
msgstr ""
"A: For details about the local build and test methods, see [Installing"
"Triton-Ascend Using the Source Code](./installation_guide.md#installing-"
"triton-ascend-using-the-source-code)."

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:62
msgid "**Q: 提交 PR 需要通过哪些 CI 检查？**"
msgstr "**Q: What CI checks are required for submitting a PR?**"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:64
msgid "A: PR 的 CI 检查包括：编码安全与规范检查、开源片段检查、恶意代码检查、编译构建、开发者测试"
msgstr ""
"A: The CI checks for a PR include: coding security and specifications"
"check, open-source code check, malicious code check, compilation and"
"building, and developer testing."

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:66
msgid "6. 性能调优"
msgstr "6\. Performance Optimization"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:68
msgid "**Q: 有没有性能分析工具（profiler）可以使用？**"
msgstr "**Q: Is there any performance analysis tool (profiler) available?**"

#: ../../zh/FAQ.md:70
msgid "A: 有集成性能分析工具（profiler），请参考 [算子性能调优方法](./debug_guide/profiling.md)"
msgstr ""
"A: There is an integrated performance analysis tool (profiler). For"
"details, see [Operator Performance Optimization"
"Methods](./debug_guide/profiling.md)."

